{"qualified":[{"c":"He is not qualified for the job.","cn":"他不勝任這份工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291052 (CK) & #889192 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291052"},{"c":"He was considered very qualified for the job.","cn":"人们认为，他完全能胜任这个工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1577216 (CM) & #1577192 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1577216"}],"quality":[{"c":"In general, consumers prefer quantity to quality.","cn":"一般來說，消费者喜歡數量勝於質量。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27341 (CK) & #798140 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27341"},{"c":"Their goods are of the highest quality.","cn":"他们的货品有着最高的品质。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2163183 (Source_VOA) & #2581556 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2163183"}],"quantity":[{"c":"In general, consumers prefer quantity to quality.","cn":"一般來說，消费者喜歡數量勝於質量。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27341 (CK) & #798140 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27341"},{"c":"Quality is more important than quantity.","cn":"数量不如质量。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #325900 (CK) & #565744 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/325900"}],"quarrel":[{"c":"Every time they meet, they quarrel.","cn":"那些人一見面就吵架。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #306278 (CK) & #13109154 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/306278"},{"c":"Whenever they meet, they quarrel.","cn":"那些人一見面就吵架。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22584 (CK) & #13109154 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22584"}],"quart":[{"c":"I want a quart of milk.","cn":"我要一夸脫的牛奶。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19459 (CK) & #864272 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19459"}],"quarter":[{"c":"It happened at a quarter past eleven.","cn":"它發生在十一點一刻。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #42838 (CK) & #798362 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/42838"},{"c":"Sales fell off in the third quarter.","cn":"在第三季時銷售跌了下來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #282524 (SUZIE) & #801322 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/282524"}],"queen":[{"c":"Queen Elizabeth I passed away in 1603.","cn":"女王伊麗莎白一世於1603年去世。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65257 (CK) & #801420 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65257"}],"question":[{"c":"I was able to answer the question.","cn":"我能回答這個問題。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #254449 (CK) & #880319 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/254449"},{"c":"I was awfully confused by his question.","cn":"我對他的問題感到非常困惑。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #403309 (CK) & #881565 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/403309"}],"quick":[{"c":"She gave the blouse a quick wash.","cn":"她很快地把襯衫洗一洗。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #311140 (CK) & #805100 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/311140"},{"c":"There's enough time for a quick snack.","cn":"有足夠的時間很快地吃一下點心。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19708 (Swift) & #797132 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19708"}],"quickly":[{"c":"He quickly went out of the room.","cn":"他很快地走出了房間。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290312 (CK) & #887713 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290312"},{"c":"I need it as quickly as possible.","cn":"我尽快需要。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #430022 (witbrock) & #333429 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/430022"}],"quiet":[{"c":"He told the students to be quiet.","cn":"他告訴了學生要安靜。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300493 (CK) & #876739 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300493"},{"c":"It became quiet again in the forest.","cn":"森林裡又再變得安靜下來了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269486 (CK) & #801338 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269486"}],"quietly":[{"c":"Please close the door quietly.","cn":"請安靜地關門。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #272060 (CK) & #836334 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/272060"},{"c":"Tom quietly closed the bedroom door.","cn":"湯姆靜靜地關上了臥室的門。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2835611 (CK) & #6128460 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2835611"}],"quilt":[{"c":"This quilt is very warm.","cn":"這條被子很暖和。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9019114 (CK) & #9046296 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9019114"}],"quit":[{"c":"His doctor advised him to quit smoking.","cn":"他的医生建议他戒烟。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1477155 (weihaiping) & #332499 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1477155"},{"c":"I don't want to quit this job.","cn":"我不想辞去这份工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1553476 (CK) & #1783797 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1553476"}],"quite":[{"c":"His wife is quite a talented woman.","cn":"他妻子是个才女。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #285632 (CK) & #1694978 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/285632"},{"c":"I am quite ignorant of their plan.","cn":"他们的计划我一无所知。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #305178 (CM) & #7835063 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/305178"}],"quiz":[{"c":"We had a history quiz this morning.","cn":"我們今天早上有歷史小考。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #242232 (CK) & #907259 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/242232"}]}
